[*] --> observe : CreateAssessment
observe --> resolve_by_lookup : tracked identity missing
resolve_by_lookup --> evaluate_ready : lookup or create reaches\nACTIVE, SUCCEEDED
resolve_by_lookup --> retryable : OCI state in CREATING,\nIN_PROGRESS, UPDATING,\nDELETING
resolve_by_lookup --> failed : unresolved OCI error or non-success state
observe --> evaluate_ready : OCI state in ACTIVE,\nSUCCEEDED
observe --> retryable : OCI state in CREATING,\nIN_PROGRESS, UPDATING,\nDELETING
observe --> failed : unresolved OCI error or non-success state
